{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>When you deliver.</b> Like בְּהוֹלִידְכֶן." "<b>On the stones.</b> The seat of the laboring woman; in another place (Isaiah 37) it is called מַשְׁבֵּר; and similarly, ״עֹשֶׂה מְלָאכָה עַל הָאָבְנָיִם״ (Jeremiah 18) — the seat of the potter's crafting-tool." "<b>If it is a son, etc.</b> He was concerned only about the males, for his astrologers had told him that a son was destined to be born who would deliver them." "<b>And she shall live.</b> And she shall live."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:07.267549632Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}